### Quick recap of the safeguards

| # | Check | What happens if it fails |
|---|---|---|
| 1 | DB file exists | Throws `"Database file not found"` |
| 2 | Order ID found | Throws `"Order not found"` |
| 3 | Email matches order | Throws `"Email mismatch"` |
| 4 | Status is `"pending"` | Throws `"Cannot update address"` |
| 5 | Status unchanged after write | Throws `"CRITICAL: Order status was unexpectedly changed"` |

